      {
        "value": "moribund",
        "source": "glottolog-cldf-v5.3",
        "note": "ǂHoan (594-huc) = Severely Endangered (60 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (The language seems to be vanishing, as no children speak ǂHoan but acquire Kgalagadi as their first language instead, along with the national language Tswana (Batibo 2005).) [Brenzinger 2011](cldf:brenzinger:11)",
        "scale": "glottolog-cldf-v5.3"
